flowchart TD
    A[Start] --> B[Prepare account-number generator query]
    B --> C[Prepare account insert query]
    C --> D[Open DB connection]
    D --> E[Fetch next account number]
    E --> F[Bind new account data and current session user ID]
    F --> G[Execute insert]
    G --> H[Create BankAccount object]
    H --> I[Add account to in-memory list]
    I --> J[Return account]
    D --> K[On SQL error print stack trace]
    K --> L[Return null]
    J --> M[End]
    L --> M
